  "description" : "Boundaries (polygons) of NYS Senate districts with name and contact info for each member of the NYS Senate. Districts based on Legislative Task Force redistricting 2022. Please contact Geospatial Services at nysgis@its.ny.gov if you have any questions. All district boundaries have been clipped to the NYS shoreline. This affects the following counties: Bronx, Cayuga, Chautauqua, Clinton, Erie, Essex, Franklin, Jefferson, Kings, Monroe, Nassau, New York, Niagara, Orleans, Oswego, Queens, Richmond, St. Lawrence, Suffolk, Washington, Wayne, Westchester.", 
